
.subckt astra_033_cmos_passive_commutating_mixer vdd VSS vip vim vcm outp outm lo
CM outm VSS 100f
CP outp VSS 100f
M1 vip lob outp vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M10 lob lo VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 vip lo outp VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 vim lo outp vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 vim lob outp VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M5 vip lo outm vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 vip lob outm VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 vim lob outm vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M8 vim lo outm VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M9 lob lo vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
RM outm vcm 40k
RP outp vcm 40k
.ends astra_033_cmos_passive_commutating_mixer
